  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "The logo of the WHO Human Reproduction Programme (HRP), reading \"human reproduction programme hrp.\" in blue and grey lettering, with the tagline \"research for impact\" beneath it and the co-sponsoring agencies UNDP, UNFPA, UNICEF, WHO and the World Bank listed at the bottom. It appears on the handbook's imprint page among the credits for contributing WHO programmes.",
